# swift-deploy-rs monitoring sample topology — a STRUCTURE EXAMPLE, never
# deployable: applies from a config_sample path are permanently refused.
#
# The monitoring bundle targets `storage_nodes`, the same children group a
# rust workspace emits, so a real apply reuses the rust project's inventory
# unchanged. The other groups are kept (possibly empty) so shared validation
# that expects the v3 group shapes keeps working.
#
# inventory_hostname is the management IP; ansible_user must be root.
